<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Thursday it would leave key interest rates unchanged and called for bids on one-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 1300 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 7.39 billion schillings, or eight percent of bids, in one-week repos.</p>
<p>Austria's discount rate remains at 2.5 percent, the Lombard rate at 4.75 percent and the Gomex money market rate at 3.4 percent, central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
